{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/ludqafjr7v3roavsp8x8p7ok4mtxukx.mp3","text":"你不是只会坐在办公室里的人，便装更方便护卫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_001.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/k6c5txypd2la51e9to6d17ijie2x51b.mp3","text":"你不是只会坐在办公室里的人，便装更方便护卫。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/4xzrk4sthbl8q2tvvxqdc4apf6g2xg7.mp3","text":"我不再怀疑罗德岛，罗德岛的事业，阿米娅和凯尔希医生，还有其他干员们值得我去尊敬。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/eizi0gt4n308yhc8fgbjfas726gap13.mp3","text":"作为干员去看待和处理事物的方法和我过去的准则完全不同，我需要很长时间去适应。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/li97z4gl0pde6t8y4gtjg2uelskhod8.mp3","text":"我从阿米娅那里听说了你们在汐斯塔的经历，看来你们度过了一个非凡的假期。我？我只能说，相当糟，但也没有那么糟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_004.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/3ctxp6crsbd81lieegh8d0olhf2lctf.mp3","text":"我不再怀疑罗德岛，罗德岛的事业，阿米娅和凯尔希医生，还有其他干员们值得我去尊敬。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/78/120cefg9mfb21mzczxyvwbwaw7vruvr.mp3","text":"作为干员去看待和处理事物的方法和我过去的准则完全不同，我需要很长时间去适应。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/80/6ah9gcbgi68o8ttvn3qm8fctmvuxo7a.mp3","text":"我从阿米娅那里听说了你们在汐斯塔的经历，看来你们度过了一个非凡的假期。我？我只能说，相当糟，但也没有那么糟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/gh5m8sv8n6pk8e4pmv917aw51t8ue7s.mp3","text":"我的根在龙门，这点永远不会改变，而那些我熟悉的景色会一直陪着我，无论我走到哪里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/50/myeyidnjb20idm1st2e8p4txn3pktwx.mp3","text":"离开龙门的时候，我一度以为我要寻找的是一个答案。现在我有些明白了，没有答案，只有方法，以及结果。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_006.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/1tk00mufggghb7weamxqe8zq8rpb9vg.mp3","text":"我的根在龙门，这点永远不会改变，而那些我熟悉的景色会一直陪着我，无论我走到哪里。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/kiosh46y2bfrf5y7wbo9ei22tteyyie.mp3","text":"离开龙门的时候，我一度以为我要寻找的是一个答案。现在我有些明白了，没有答案，只有方法，以及结果。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/nkj3jjp9z9v2ayter5u5yrz2m5g30mc.mp3","text":"博士，我已经离开龙门作为干员加入罗德岛有一段时间，你也应该习惯将我作为一名干员对待了。你总是表现得束手束脚的话，我也很难办。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/8olyiv4svaqe5724mdbo0s52lk6nm5i.mp3","text":"我被许多人信赖着，而过去的我只是将这当成一种理所当然，我明白。我会学着回应他们，虽然这对我来说，大概比一天完成十套高级训练课程都要难。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/rtk5ycvfjinsb5wybkflz6jompf4ucs.mp3","text":"无论是切尔诺伯格发生的事，还是我在多索雷斯的经历，都让我坚定了一个想法——如果我想要对付或者拯救某一样东西，不首先去了解它是不行的。我必须看得更多，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_009.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/pyor1ho31ih8axoj8tkteey69w7rr5w.mp3","text":"博士，我已经离开龙门作为干员加入罗德岛有一段时间，你也应该习惯将我作为一名干员对待了。你总是表现得束手束脚的话，我也很难办。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/ao6r8y49zwj1o7fh368l3u7sg5ztwly.mp3","text":"我被许多人信赖着，而过去的我只是将这当成一种理所当然，我明白。我会学着回应他们，虽然这对我来说，大概比一天完成十套高级训练课程都要难。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/g8fno0wzyk4j89jvc9v11cjz8906ss8.mp3","text":"无论是切尔诺伯格发生的事，还是我在多索雷斯的经历，都让我坚定了一个想法——如果我想要对付或者拯救某一样东西，不首先去了解它是不行的。我必须看得更多，博士。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/lldtpga44nbeplztraa99a0qaaejiwt.mp3","text":"又睡着了......今天的工作已经完成了不少，就让你休息十分钟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_010.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/5qzbt5rjuv2414h94rk4obj7kyk8ww1.mp3","text":"又睡着了......今天的工作已经完成了不少，就让你休息十分钟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/6cipve243fp8psn8t8bioyb9ad94ub3.mp3","text":"陈，从多索雷斯度假归来。关于这次度假，我有不少报告要写，所以只是路过来跟你打个招呼，博士。要出任务了叫我，假期结束了，一切照旧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_011.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/fit5aci2e8tlw61g7lcoxugh0cbtfk0.mp3","text":"陈，从多索雷斯度假归来。关于这次度假，我有不少报告要写，所以只是路过来跟你打个招呼，博士。要出任务了叫我，假期结束了，一切照旧。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/j8zqz3mk8pwezbpozq28n82k68li0uy.mp3","text":"人外有人，天外有天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_012.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/pad4hw1v2v3u0jl1jtpqtbgr4ipry7p.mp3","text":"人外有人，天外有天。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/rwweki8ylmn805b0givp0mqkjgefri0.mp3","text":"作为狙击干员的晋升？也好，我可以做这个榜样。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_013.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/dxhraxq707dh5h6no9o2wd1mdpyo9rb.mp3","text":"作为狙击干员的晋升？也好，我可以做这个榜样。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/e3etuzgftwmfpsb82ibf59gbs1609u1.mp3","text":"老实说，我一开始也没想过我会精进射击技巧到这个地步，对我来说，还是剑更加趁手。只是在某些场合，射击确实更加便利。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_014.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/hlzlxt7asxqiudmlxflqq5tk51qjtsu.mp3","text":"老实说，我一开始也没想过我会精进射击技巧到这个地步，对我来说，还是剑更加趁手。只是在某些场合，射击确实更加便利。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/nqc1g7maxnvp5mi34xtbqhv50izyvkg.mp3","text":"收到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_017.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/i2dtcpqnmecqjsqbjklg96q5542483h.mp3","text":"收到。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/6s0sr4l1tuug160jpg3g85kad84g2t0.mp3","text":"不用紧张，我会兜底。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_018.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/2jgj7rnsbiqthtc027zlfn3f09ihd33.mp3","text":"不用紧张，我会兜底。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/893onph1berwl84ziym92670gpmdfg9.mp3","text":"都打起精神，准备作战了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_019.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/6dscmn9fks89fou9k42aa5bv0qrdz0z.mp3","text":"都打起精神，准备作战了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/gbo860efe9owwjjs61w2k8oo5zvmw1a.mp3","text":"都准备好了吗？那么，走。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_020.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/7upumu5lgc1jl8t3fsyaugo7nqokqgh.mp3","text":"都准备好了吗？那么，走。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/ftuxghzq04yw32kw75r1wfx8gg9awa3.mp3","text":"我看到敌人了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/gkly2ce06o5jg4cois8sd7xeqoqgqrn.mp3","text":"陈，随时待命。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_022.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/55heilmrb8bac5n60vwms2zujq4db5k.mp3","text":"我看到敌人了。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/o3i5m8zw5uxpnyl1sjw46v3fpyeiq97.mp3","text":"陈，随时待命。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/ryo3knifpx93talu9htd8apv007s2mx.mp3","text":"这里交给我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/qse3pb87igtgu7fkoakb8vv6u53dwbr.mp3","text":"好位置。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_024.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/l40zpni59r9pbnteu0twgrinm2qjosb.mp3","text":"这里交给我。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/qp57g64vv3x9br0tg4bivahg81o0sb4.mp3","text":"好位置。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/lgknpi2iqw9t67vsib2hnaul9skjduj.mp3","text":"哼！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/ggfnd2473zag9kgo4om4k4jr2etqa6v.mp3","text":"留下他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/kmf65pgnd5zvi9imjznrdrtxo46fb3r.mp3","text":"我来火力压制！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/faggxwkesplokiw6ayxhn5dsnxygowb.mp3","text":"时间有限。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_028.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/6fd9k6jcmr38fcdyaf2n9e4p6xz0bm4.mp3","text":"哼！","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/213illpjlz51kjn8oh7awobez5pwqni.mp3","text":"留下他们。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/obfue24i83oam2hyvjeppb969dnv9vy.mp3","text":"我来火力压制！","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/63/io8g4oqoltdjw66wyly8uouzzrc7z23.mp3","text":"时间有限。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/q1soowfx1w78bbr20dvhssck9qz1pzl.mp3","text":"纯粹的邪恶与磨难并不可怕，可怕的是它们往往并不纯粹。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_029.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/43wdrntensfwvlpkogngg4fhqb3kxfh.mp3","text":"纯粹的邪恶与磨难并不可怕，可怕的是它们往往并不纯粹。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/fx1us9823thnxl5vbekaq5d16krnnz3.mp3","text":"一次漂亮的团队协作，各位，做得好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_030.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/r2qniwsa9oeldar5fgevzv78vxgmnr0.mp3","text":"一次漂亮的团队协作，各位，做得好。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/0cuvqfoa2efvmlhy1ockuji28tzpgw3.mp3","text":"有力气的先救助伤员，再来几个跟我警戒周边。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_031.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/gfe4wl1h75p65l42whwhmm3u8xzmpay.mp3","text":"有力气的先救助伤员，再来几个跟我警戒周边。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/keipa9ilkftjh3m944d2r02x6nqx7me.mp3","text":"有序撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_032.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/6jvjgfq6wjvjp27bt6yoe9g0vk4l7rp.mp3","text":"有序撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/d66twtfp4gv23js0nbjopazja48bgtx.mp3","text":"嗯？又增加了新的房间？工程部真有精神。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_033.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/ncor710odzj7redkjo6lgchedxlcwlt.mp3","text":"嗯？又增加了新的房间？工程部真有精神。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2d/t278tvus8bjy07jw6ibeiylabccp385.mp3","text":"屡教不改啊，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_034.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/sbqm3k2gqroano3oi6yeqqm7xvc1q1f.mp3","text":"屡教不改啊，博士。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/2kc0eukktql58b0f7rzrkxnusyro49q.mp3","text":"博士，你接下来要出外勤？我可以陪你走一趟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_036.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/l6wrfuypuvayq59v0wjm6vozeedxu5p.mp3","text":"博士，你接下来要出外勤？我可以陪你走一趟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/j12w3ewbq3te9vbr7k52uz65losxm28.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_037.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/j2jtnk7vwg513fwhw66zwqg5ts8ds9u.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/qhfwrfxi39ifx333x7421pdbkarbf6j.mp3","text":"新年晚会？我会去的。星熊和诗怀雅都来了，真是不容易，居然能在这里聚齐。对了，诗怀雅说她带了一些龙门小吃，你记得喊阿米娅也来尝一尝。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_038.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/56/eig175e15c8or2o9y5tcekfrriz7dn4.mp3","text":"新年晚会？我会去的。星熊和诗怀雅都来了，真是不容易，居然能在这里聚齐。对了，诗怀雅说她带了一些龙门小吃，你记得喊阿米娅也来尝一尝。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/eownsx7lu7urh9piflqgr01aapddquw.mp3","text":"博士，精神不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_1013_chen2/cn_042.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/5wh1efrfn4mobon23247z8gtzp8jsuk.mp3","text":"博士，精神不错。","alt":"voice_custom/char_1013_chen2_cn_topolect/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/kvd5yopvx83r6ic0dsnwgrodbzw8rc9.mp3","text":"你不是只会坐在办公室里的人，便装更方便护卫。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/2orkgtgnpy23qegaf6x27xmr5tp1en1.mp3","text":"我不再怀疑罗德岛，罗德岛的事业，阿米娅和凯尔希医生，还有其他干员们值得我去尊敬。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/lsjxsh4mrmku2r2vjhx2w8scisrguy8.mp3","text":"作为干员去看待和处理事物的方法和我过去的准则完全不同，我需要很长时间去适应。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/03/95wkv8mj3e7nf1rpi3kmzave1k6h6li.mp3","text":"我从阿米娅那里听说了你们在汐斯塔的经历，看来你们度过了一个非凡的假期。我？我只能说，相当糟，但也没有那么糟。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/e9o9vv8q7a47t58qa71i1fztpik3mtx.mp3","text":"我的根在龙门，这点永远不会改变，而那些我熟悉的景色会一直陪着我，无论我走到哪里。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/19/rs3rk8tjbgtpl6iyolsghquskezofmh.mp3","text":"离开龙门的时候，我一度以为我要寻找的是一个答案。现在我有些明白了，没有答案，只有方法，以及结果。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/bfqu5bf4krkjs8luwdkry27xhqp9x57.mp3","text":"博士，我已经离开龙门作为干员加入罗德岛有一段时间，你也应该习惯将我作为一名干员对待了。你总是表现得束手束脚的话，我也很难办。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/dwwrqs4n6o0edjk9dw0id898qeobxbf.mp3","text":"我被许多人信赖着，而过去的我只是将这当成一种理所当然，我明白。我会学着回应他们，虽然这对我来说，大概比一天完成十套高级训练课程都要难。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/as6s0uyz9p5emxf6ox55ru0fepdk530.mp3","text":"无论是切尔诺伯格发生的事，还是我在多索雷斯的经历，都让我坚定了一个想法——如果我想要对付或者拯救某一样东西，不首先去了解它是不行的。我必须看得更多，博士。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/0gp5h8kvk3182k7uceb50s0rbns90rg.mp3","text":"又睡着了......今天的工作已经完成了不少，就让你休息十分钟。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/s6xhzlr9p5vgj4znc3h4fn3ofh0j08a.mp3","text":"陈，从多索雷斯度假归来。关于这次度假，我有不少报告要写，所以只是路过来跟你打个招呼，博士。要出任务了叫我，假期结束了，一切照旧。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/7uyv1261koghual9k9q7rntedmjd1e2.mp3","text":"人外有人，天外有天。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/rbsd4qgnn0kn9ylv877d84amrmh2aky.mp3","text":"作为狙击干员的晋升？也好，我可以做这个榜样。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/tjyewbbs2g9q6n265vs05srobt2m2a5.mp3","text":"老实说，我一开始也没想过我会精进射击技巧到这个地步，对我来说，还是剑更加趁手。只是在某些场合，射击确实更加便利。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/nwsqoy3b9x28mx58e65g6ibrxpplwax.mp3","text":"收到。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/tk4ci3i9k9hl9ac9j77itz1klmrilkr.mp3","text":"不用紧张，我会兜底。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/8os5zh99o314d672c25vaiywnsixgpt.mp3","text":"都打起精神，准备作战了。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/9npebhbxc3vsqczbfwjnszruhy4r1jc.mp3","text":"都准备好了吗？那么，走。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/6wkn9ivq6i98lz6cqezm4bui0pdmrky.mp3","text":"我看到敌人了。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/03/nfkti1tddekntafw02oeqr0x1o4vdne.mp3","text":"陈，随时待命。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/rhh4rfrrknl7rghozcm2afhcfbkq3y6.mp3","text":"这里交给我。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/lzvd9khspq7ehkxmd3kq1c5b2p1ik6m.mp3","text":"好位置。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/ge51ptdzvf19s7pi4vadunzfs35qy3k.mp3","text":"哼！","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/3ho7cxbynnhfofip0n2iz66td2g008e.mp3","text":"留下他们。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/997yijmitiszspu884usfrp5ycwlu4v.mp3","text":"我来火力压制！","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/b12wp2uip7gihkjzkd6qzpxk2pm4snl.mp3","text":"时间有限。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/512cc6lab0b5cwaih5hwega00px4gqf.mp3","text":"纯粹的邪恶与磨难并不可怕，可怕的是它们往往并不纯粹。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/5db2gout6b30ulj50jl8k1z43qmyfbt.mp3","text":"一次漂亮的团队协作，各位，做得好。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/8e1jq6vlnx7bmrzihk1rk1zl11kover.mp3","text":"有力气的先救助伤员，再来几个跟我警戒周边。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/5gymjhh36trjdtwev1fxxwz1s0opjz4.mp3","text":"有序撤退，我来殿后！","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/4e4vfyhctq389fazyo4a7q91s2wfrgh.mp3","text":"嗯？又增加了新的房间？工程部真有精神。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/rqvbfhl69qcm8os6mhd1jwyq29l1cjm.mp3","text":"屡教不改啊，博士。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/k2dq3jmndvoha8n169w3wcz68dll9d2.mp3","text":"博士，你接下来要出外勤？我可以陪你走一趟。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/gdax4q7hml67s707krf1b5heflhevx0.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/fl0amhtf69qxv7bpox60kuq2en0l180.mp3","text":"新年晚会？我会去的。星熊和诗怀雅都来了，真是不容易，居然能在这里聚齐。对了，诗怀雅说她带了一些龙门小吃，你记得喊阿米娅也来尝一尝。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7e/11xajz1fskyhhhc9gyrr75u21ybcjsc.mp3","text":"博士，精神不错。","alt":"voice/char_1013_chen2/cn_042.mp3"}]}}